I'll be presenting at <a ref="https://www.colorado.edu/symposium/hls2026/" target= "_blank">the Hispanic Linguistics Symposium (HLS 2026) in Boulder, CO</a>, as part of a colloquium I co-organized with <a ref="https://spanish.arizona.edu/people/simonet" target= "_blank">Miquel Simonet</a>. 

